4-3 in OT. \n\nThis kid is incredible.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/stefenrosner.bsky.social/post/3mz2qyx2zjh2n"},{"a":"Stefen Rosner","d":"2026-10-30T02:40:34+00:00","h":"stefenrosner.bsky.social","o":"NHL.com","t":"#Isles OT starters: Horvat-Pagea-Schaefer with Pageau likely to bench after face-off win... if","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/stefenrosner.bsky.social/post/3mz2qwbhlh72v"},{"a":"Stefen Rosner","d":"2026-10-30T02:30:32+00:00","h":"stefenrosner.bsky.social","o":"NHL.com","t":"Oof. Boldy beats Sorokin through the legs with 3:53 to go in the third. Schaefer gets caught. 3-3. #Isles","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/stefenrosner.bsky.social/post/3mz2qed3hf32v"},{"a":"Stefen Rosner","d":"2026-10-30T01:22:10+00:00","h":"stefenrosner.bsky.social","o":"NHL.com","t":"Heck of a job by #Isles Pageau line and DeAngelo-Schaefer as NYI got momentum following PK.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/stefenrosner.bsky.social/post/3mz2mk3b5ub2m"},{"a":"Stefen Rosner","d":"2026-10-30T00:44:42+00:00","h":"stefenrosner.bsky.social","o":"NHL.com","t":"Not a great start for #Isles, but they got better as the period went on. #MNWild are so tough to defend. \n\nNYI kept the deficit at 1-0 before a great pass from Eklund to Heineman led to a smart shot and a smart read by Schaefer to tie things up.  Solid period of hockey.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/stefenrosner.bsky.social/post/3mz2kh3open2m"},{"a":"Stefen Rosner","d":"2026-10-30T00:37:09+00:00","h":"stefenrosner.bsky.social","o":"NHL.com","t":"Matthew Schaefer. 1-1. Deposits a Heineman rebound with 3:24 to play in the first period. #Isles","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/stefenrosner.bsky.social/post/3mz2jzloi7e2x"},{"a":"Heather Rule","d":"2026-10-30T00:36:37+00:00","h":"hlrule.bsky.social","o":"NHL.com","t":"Tie game with 3:24 left in the first period. \n\nMatthew Schaefer with his third of the season.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/hlrule.bsky.social/post/3mz2jymuyyc2c"},{"a":"Jeff Paterson","d":"2026-10-28T07:45:48+00:00","h":"